L-A&oe=6AAFE337"}, {"file_name": "3082402d067c8e848814849fe0d5ece3.png", "id": "1223622479810765", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303585_1223622483144098_7063076556162011975_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yEmR4udBk6AQ7kNvwFgppFe&_nc_oc=AdpXrvk5KqJF4EhvGQ2H3ontOGoJx8C8sPekWqkQdB9QtewHBSorP-j--_qTAJd4w7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGxcfksOpLO2X1rZm28GGC6bN-6SfeYyjgXVIHgB2hqg&oe=6AAFDC0C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RSS Scroll", "keywords": ["RSS", "news", "feed", "Reader", "Articles"], "long_description": "RSS Scroll lets you add and manage your favorite RSS feeds, then browse articles in a stylish card-based interface or a traditional feed list.\n\n- Add any RSS feed URL\n- Home screen shows full-screen article cards\n- Feed screen shows a fast list view\n- Filter articles by category\n- Open articles in your browser\n\nPerfect for news, blogs, tech updates, and hobby sites \u2014 build your own personalized content stream.", "short_description": "A sleek RSS reader that shows your feeds in card and list views."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "rss-reels.png", "id": "26677083185285001", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_26677083191951667_4710502587857460224_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zlzcMUMWs9cQ7kNvwEqOJGF&_nc_oc=Adp_wzyBFPguh5Yb75SdmGBUZOTiK2Hfk_1BIutsHnTNQmBCk9z0CdK7g1GS5kafi9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI3xca9GLFEbJXVnkaeoUZNE4sVBhl_7JwMccRiff7zUg&oe=6AAFD30D"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1598558734570356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_1598558737903689_1704160935439350811_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LaxfyRd5Qe0Q7kNvwHiOPFD&_nc_oc=AdqraC5g1VNcdjQkdaiHK-Tzi3DRoV47uWFVR7q1UGrdf2X4AufJ9PiEUr2_5nB